vation":0,"flags":{"ddbActorFlags":{"creatureFlags":[],"creatureGroup":null,"entityTypeId":779871897,"flatAC":true,"id":16835,"name":"Cultist","version":"2.7.2"}},"height":1,"hidden":false,"name":"Cultist","scale":1,"tint":null,"width":1,"x":5100,"y":3100},{"_id":"8nr8B2wFpLuL7i2t","actorData":{"data":{"details":{"alignment":"Lawful Evil","type":{"subtype":"Human"}},"resources":{"lair":{"value":false}}},"oldHpVal":9},"actorLink":false,"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"disposition":-1,"elevation":0,"flags":{"ddbActorFlags":{"creatureFlags":[],"creatureGroup":null,"entityTypeId":779871897,"flatAC":true,"id":16835,"name":"Cultist","version":"2.7.2"}},"height":1,"hidden":false,"name":"Cultist","scale":1,"tint":null,"width":1,"x":5000,"y":3000},{"_id":"96MUKLbSYNU8d6Jd","actorData":{"data":{"details":{"alignment":"Lawful Evil","type":{"subtype":"Human"}},"resources":{"lair":{"value":false}}},"oldHpVal":9},"actorLink":false,"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"disposition":-1,"elevation":0,"flags":{"ddbActorFlags":{"creatureFlags":[],"creatureGroup":null,"entityTypeId":779871897,"flatAC":true,"id":16835,"name":"Cultist","version":"2.7.2"}},"height":1,"hidden":false,"name":"Cultist","scale":1,"tint":null,"width":1,"x":5000,"y":3200},{"_id":"1mYXAGktqJgd8fMz","actorData":{},"actorLink":false,"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"disposition":-1,"elevation":0,"flags":{"ddbActorFlags":{"creatureFlags":[],"creatureGroup":null,"entityTypeId":779871897,"flatAC":true,"id":417078,"name":"Duke Thalamra Vanthampur","version":"2.7.2"}},"height":1,"hidden":false,"name":"Duke Thalamra Vanthampur","scale":1,"tint":null,"width":1,"x":5002.240097313596,"y":3752.292994449013},{"_id":"sh4XeaXeLtoUItBb","actorData":{"data":{"resources":{"lair":{"value":false}}},"name":"Thoss","oldHpVal":52},"actorLink":false,"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"disposition":-1,"elevation":0,"flags":{"ddbActorFlags":{"creatureFlags":[],"creatureGroup":null,"entityTypeId":779871897,"flatAC":true,"id":16803,"name":"Bearded Devil","version":"2.7.2"}},"height":1,"hidden":false,"name":"Thoss","scale":1,"tint":null,"width":1,"x":6300,"y":4500},{"_id":"DKQLvVe4PaXADDlb","actorData":{"data":{"details":{"alignment":"Neutral","biography":{"value":"<p id=\"FalasterFisk\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; user-select: text; color: #191813;\" data-content-chunk-id=\"5efd7032-8d64-468f-996f-2bf3fe35237c\">Originally from Calimshan, Falaster is a neutral&nbsp;<a class=\"entity-link content-link\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; user-select: text; background: var(--color-dark); padding-left: 6px; border: 1x var(--color-dark); color: var(--color-bright); text-indent: initial;\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"world.ddb-Forgotten-Realms-monsters\" data-id=\"M2StnMK2MeWTsc2U\">&nbsp;spy</a>&nbsp;with no weapons. He speaks Common and Infernal, wears an ankle-length caftan, and has dark hair. His neatly trimmed goatee beard is dyed crimson.</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; user-select: text; color: #191813;\" data-content-chunk-id=\"7350ac8e-e4e8-4bef-ac97-9eaa5f72752b\">Falaster works for Sylvira Savikas, a tiefling expert on the Nine Hells currently based in Candlekeep. When Thavius Kreeg arrived in Baldur&rsquo;s Gate a few days ago, it didn&rsquo;t take Falaster long to hear rumors that the Vanthampurs were sheltering him. Falaster tried to find out why and was caught. He can provide his rescuers with the following useful information:</p>\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; user-select: text; color: #191813;\" data-content-chunk-id=\"ae0d381e-38b3-49a9-975e-c30347bf180f\">\n<li class=\"Core-Styles_Core-Bulleted\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; user-select: text;\" data-content-chunk-id=\"c5aa1ef4-a46b-4689-b456-b2c84784afb6\">&ldquo;Sylvira Savikas is a sage who operates out of Candlekeep. A good friend of mine! She&rsquo;s been monitoring devil activity in Baldur&rsquo;s Gate and Elturel for months.&rdquo;</li>\n<li class=\"Core-Styles_Core-Bulleted\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; user-select: text;\" data-content-chunk-id=\"a2777974-9ca8-493a-9e8b-c1376bf4e388\">&ldquo;Sylvira is convinced that Thavius Kreeg struck a bargain with an archdevil, and that a copy of the contract he signed is hidden inside a magic puzzle box. She asked me to help her obtain proof of Kreeg&rsquo;s crimes.&rdquo;</li>\n<li class=\"Core-Styles_Core-Bulleted-Extra-Space-After-\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; user-select: text;\" data-content-chunk-id=\"3fc9d83a-504d-4496-a149-d2b18a873a26\">&ldquo;Sylvira is no friend of Thavius Kreeg&rsquo;s. She thinks she can open his puzzle box, and is willing to pay for it &mdash; in gold or magic items.&rdquo;</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; user-select: text; color: #191813;\" data-content-chunk-id=\"81dc6d7e-0702-4ab6-87e6-65830d518a59\">If released, Falaster helps the characters as best he can while staying out of harm&rsquo;s way. Expecting that he might be caught, he obtained and memorized a floor plan of the dungeon under Vanthampur Villa. He can thus lead his rescuers to secret rooms (areas V28 and V34) and the Vanthampurs&rsquo; vault (area V36).</p>"},"type":{"subtype":"Human"}},"resources":{"lair":{"value":false}}},"name":"Falaster Fisk","oldHpVal":27},"actorLink":false,"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"disposition":0,"elevation":0,"flags":{"ddbActorFlags":{"creatureFlags":[],"creatureGroup":null,"entityTypeId":779871897,"flatAC":true,"id":17021,"name":"Spy","version":"2.7.2"}},"height":1,"hidden":false,"name":"Falaster Fisk","scale":1,"tint":null,"width":1,"x":6000,"y":4400},{"_id":"Ly3kp1aOuLGkX2As","actorData":{"data":{"details":{"alignment":"Neutral Evil","biography":{"value":"<p id=\"SatiirThioneHhune\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; user-select: text; color: #191813;\" data-content-chunk-id=\"3f390178-aa8c-4c02-b428-59643b42f698\">A fit, aristocratic human woman in her seventies named Lady Satiir Thione-Hhune. Born into the rich and politically powerful Hhune patriar family, Satiir is a neutral evil <a class=\"entity-link content-link\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; user-select: text; background: var(--color-dark); padding-left: 6px; border: 1x var(--color-dark); color: var(--color-bright); text-indent: initial;\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"world.ddb-Forgotten-Realms-monsters\" data-id=\"XV4ZHQEEM89rdPYV\">&nbsp;noble</a>&nbsp;with no weapons or armor (AC 11). She was kidnapped by the Vanthampurs to be used as leverage in the event that the Hhunes find out who stole the&nbsp;<a class=\"entity-link content-link\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; user-select: text; background: var(--color-dark); padding-left: 6px; border: 1x var(--color-dark); color: var(--color-bright); text-indent: initial;\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"world.ddb-Forgotten-Realms-items\" data-id=\"PLaf9kkzE0wD4sdt\">&nbsp;Shield of the Hidden Lord</a>&nbsp;from their family&rsquo;s crypt.</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; user-select: text; color: #191813;\" data-content-chunk-id=\"71cacbfe-87a4-4bdb-8e12-3734cb072f61\">Unknown to the Vanthampurs, Satiir is a member of a secret evil order whose members call themselves the Knights of the Shield, and who are the self-appointed guardians of the&nbsp;<a class=\"entity-link content-link\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; user-select: text; background: var(--color-dark); padding-left: 6px; border: 1x var(--color-dark); color: var(--color-bright); text-indent: initial;\" draggable=\"true\" data-pack=\"world.ddb-Forgotten-Realms-items\" data-id=\"PLaf9kkzE0wD4sdt\">&nbsp;Shield of the Hidden Lord</a>. Satiir doesn&rsquo;t speak of the shield. Instead, she tells her rescuers that the Vanthampurs were planning to use her to keep the Hhunes from opposing Duke Vanthampur&rsquo;s bid to become the new grand duke. If Satiir is allowed to escape, she informs her family and associates that the Vanthampurs stole the shield, destroying Duke Vanthampur&rsquo;s political future in Baldur&rsquo;s Gate. The characters might encounter more of Satiir&rsquo;s friends on the way to Candlekeep (see &ldquo;Knights of the Shield&rdquo;).</p>"},"type":{"subtype":"Human"}},"resources":{"lair":{"value":false}}},"name":"Lady Satiir Thione-Hhune","oldHpVal":9},"actorLink":false,"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"disposition":0,"elevation":0,"flags":{"ddbActorFlags":{"creatureFlags":[],"creatureGroup":null,"entityTypeId":779871897,"flatAC":true,"id":16966,"name":"Noble","version":"2.7.2"}},"height":1,"hidden":false,"name":"Lady Satiir Thione-Hhune","scale":1,"tint":null,"width":1,"x":6300,"y":4900},{"_id":"HGfqH0cJoObYA5bR","actorData":{"data":{"details":{"alignment":"Lawful Evil","type":{"subtype":"Human"}},"resources":{"lair":{"value":false}}},"oldHpVal":9},"actorLink":false,"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"disposition":-1,"elevation":0,"flags":{"ddbActorFlags":{"creatureFlags":[],"creatureGroup":null,"entityTypeId":779871897,"flatAC":true,"id":16835,"name":"Cultist","version":"2.7.2"}},"height":1,"hidden":false,"name":"Cultist","scale":1,"tint":null,"width":1,"x":2600,"y":3100},{"_id":"CPUKBoYqWKWkA0KL","actorData":{"data":{"details":{"alignment":"Lawful Evil","type":{"subtype":"Human"}},"resources":{"lair":{"value":false}}},"oldHpVal":9},"actorLink":false,"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"disposition":-1,"elevation":0,"flags":{"ddbActorFlags":{"creatureFlags":[],"creatureGroup":null,"entityTypeId":779871897,"flatAC":true,"id":16835,"name":"Cultist","version":"2.7.2"}},"height":1,"hidden":false,"name":"Cultist","scale":1,"tint":null,"width":1,"x":2800,"y":3100},{"_id":"ssZiaBhbtswCfIxp","actorData":{"data":{"details":{"alignment":"Lawful Evil","type":{"subtype":"Human"}},"resources":{"lair":{"value":false}}},"oldHpVal":9},"actorLink":false,"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"disposition":-1,"elevation":0,"flags":{"ddbActorFlags":{"creatureFlags":[],"creatureGroup":null,"entityTypeId":779871897,"flatAC":true,"id":16835,"name":"Cultist","version":"2.7.2"}},"height":1,"hidden":false,"name":"C